      "username": "AnachronismAxe",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/anachronismaxe/{size}/2163_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-19T21:58:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There have to be 4 Citizens <span class=\"bbcode-i\">revealed from the deck and put into play</span>. Since Citizen Dawn is put into play first as part of her setup, she is not revealed from her deck. Four other Citizens need to come from the deck.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Aside from Citizen Dare, I believe, who is an edge case and doesn’t count in setup.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:07:36.299Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
